   "media": [],
   "urls": [],
   "isRetweet": false,
   "retweetedBy": null,
   "lang": "en",
   "score": null
  },
  {
   "id": "2088366984677511218",
   "text": "And when you're running autonomous coding loops doing 30+ tool calls per task, that $25/M token meter spins out of control fast.\n\nOn a single 4090/3090, you get that same frontier reasoning for 20 cents of wall electricity, zero rate limits during peak hours, and your proprietary codebase never leaves your local NVMe.",
   "author": {
    "id": "2207203190",
    "name": "Alok",
    "screenName": "analogalok",
    "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2055727708261474304/tUAKpN50_normal.jpg",
    "verified": true
   },
   "metrics": {
    "likes": 8,
