  {
   "id": "2088464427569815837",
   "text": "@analogalok I’m looking at getting an M5 pro or max with 64 GB or RAM. i do think though about springing for 128 so I’ll be safe for the next few years. But this is amazing for 24 GB only. With 64 would have a lot left over for me using the computer still",
   "author": {
    "id": "2576316264",
    "name": "Jake",
    "screenName": "jakerumbles",
    "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1790138394820947968/RIXCgZ0U_normal.jpg",
    "verified": false
   },
   "metrics": {
    "likes": 2,
    "retweets": 0,
    "replies": 2,
    "quotes": 0,
    "views": 348,
    "bookmarks": 0
